    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to present this charming two storey residence, superbly positioned just a one minute stroll from the picturesque waterfront of Monkstown Bay. Enjoying an exceptional setting in one of Cork Harbour's most sought after residential locations, this attractive home offers the perfect blend of coastal living and everyday convenience. The property is within easy walking distance of an excellent range of local amenities, including the sailing club, marina, tennis club and golf club, making it an ideal choice for those seeking an active lifestyle in a beautiful maritime setting. With the scenic promenade and stunning harbour views on your doorstep, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a home in an enviable and highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Room and Bathroom. First floor with three bedrooms, Master bedroom ensuite and bathroom.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 3.87 m x 3.48 m\r\nCarpeted. Open fireplace with coal effect gas fired insert. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 3.9 m x 5.13 m\r\nVinyl flooring. Modern fitted kitchen units with integrated gas hob, washing machine, fridge-freezer and oven included. Bowl and a half stainless steel sink, tiling over worktop. Centre island with storage under and breakfast chairs included. White aluminium PVC door to rear yard.\r\n\r\nFirst floor with spacious, carpeted landing.\r\nBedroom One: 3.7 m x 3.14 m\r\nCarpeted. Recessed double wardrobe. Spacious ensuite off.\r\nEnsuite carpeted with white suite of toilet, wash hand basin and pedestal. Corner shower enclosure with sliding shower doors and electric shower unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two: 3.86 m x 2.65 m\r\nCarpeted.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three: 2.6 m x 2.8 m \r\nCarpeted. \r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\nCarpeted. White suite of toilet, wash hand basin, pedestal and bath.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nEnclosed private rear yard. Wooden garden shed. Side garden with potential for off street parking area. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nMains water, mains sewer, bulk tank gas fired central heating (immersion not working).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSale to Include:\r\nCarpets, curtains, oven, hob, fridge-freezer, washing machine, breakfast island and chairs, wooden garden shed and garden implements. Furniture available at a purchasers discretion.\r\n\r\nTitle:\r\nFreehold."
      },
